# The entries below override core "sale"/"sale_management" terms with the
# European Portuguese wording (as opposed to Odoo's own upstream pt.po,
# which mixes in Brazilian terms like "Cotação"). They previously lived in
# an "i18n_extra/pt.po" file, which Odoo never loads — only a module's own
# "i18n/" folder is scanned on install/update, so none of this ever took
# effect (UAT vendas/stock, ponto 8 — Matias: printed document title not
# translated to "Orçamento", 2026-08-27). Loading a dependent module
# (l10n_pt_sale depends on sale, sale_management via sale_management) after
# its dependency lets its own translations override the core ones for the
# same msgid, same mechanism used by other l10n modules.

